================================================================================
2. Third-party material (audio, MIDI, symbolic scores)
================================================================================

This repository also contains, or provides files derived from, third-party
material (audio masters by King Gizzard & The Lizard Wizard, MIDI by 8-bit
Escapades, and MusicXML scores derived from both). None of this material is
covered by the CC BY-SA 4.0 license above. It remains subject to its
original authors' and rights holders' terms.

See the "License summary by file type" table in README.md for details on
each file type, its source, and its applicable license or restrictions.
